<title>HONG KONG: Grand Orient 1996 net returns to profit.</title>
<headline>Grand Orient 1996 net returns to profit.</headline>
<dateline>HONG KONG 1997-04-25</dateline>
<text>
<p>Year ended December 31</p>
<p>(in million HK$ unless stated)</p>
<p>    Shr (H.K. cents)	   14.6 gain    vs  54.0 loss</p>
<p>    Dividend (H.K. cents)    nil	    vs  nil</p>
<p>    Exceptional items	  nil	    vs  21.80 loss</p>
<p>    Net			    36.63 profit vs  79.23 loss</p>
<p>    Turnover		     547.39	 vs  55.38</p>
<p>    Company name		 Grand Orient Holdings Ltd</p>
<p>    Books close		  June 4-10</p>
<p>    Dividend payable	   June 23</p>
<p>NOTE - Grand Orient invests in property and securities.</p>
<p>The company proposed a distribution of five H.K. cents per share vs nil.</p>
<p>-- Hong Kong newsroom (852) 2843 6368</p>
</text>
